  m_text: "Controls\n\nKey:\nIn Gravity: \xAC\nIn Space: *\nIn Inventory: #\n\nMovement
    > WASD (\xAC *)\nMouse > Look (\xAC *)\nSprint, Thruster Max Power > (\xAC *)\nJump,
    Thruster Up > Space (\xAC *)\nCrouch, Thruster Down > C (\xAC), (*)\nThruster
    Stabilise > CTRL (*)\nRoll > Q/E (*)\nUse Item In Hand > Left Mouse (\xAC *)\nAlt
    Use Item In Hand > Right Mouse (\xAC *)\nInteract > F (\xAC *)\nDropItem > G
    (\xAC * #)\nScroll Item Hotbar > Mouse Wheel (#)\nRotate Item > R (#)\nItem Context
    Menu > Right Mouse (#)\nHotbar Slots > 1-4 (\xAC *)\nTAB > Monitoring Menu (\xAC
    * #)\nESC > Pause Menu (\xAC * #)\n\n"
